  "details": "With the removal of buttons moving when hovered, it is now nearly impossible to distinguish what button is hovered over, with custom UI Themes. This includes the included UI Themes with VRC+. \n\nThe default theme hover state is very noticeable, while the custom UI Themes are not at all. The main issues are buttons used in the wings for worlds, friends, profile. MM buttons for worlds, avatars, and users. \n\nVideo example: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oQDpqw_hpVE",
